      "pos": "v. 系动词",
      "category": "be 与助动词",
      "usage": "系动词连接主语和表语；现在时常见 am、is、are，过去时常见 was、were。",
      "examples": [
        {
          "sentence": "She is happy.",
          "translation": "她很开心。",
          "exampleOrigin": "manual"
