      "sourceSection": "第二阶段 找到句子的核心",
      "sourceKind": "manual",
      "exampleOrigin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "id": 100010,
      "word": "am",
      "meaning": "是；be 与 I 搭配的现在时形式",
      "pos": "v. 系动词",
      "category": "be 与助动词",
      "usage": "现在时先记 I am；在 I am a student. 中 am 是系动词，a student 是表语。",
      "examples": [
        {
          "sentence": "I am a student.",
          "translation": "我是一名学生。",
          "exampleOrigin": "manual"
