      "pos": "v. 系动词",
      "category": "be 与助动词",
      "usage": "描述状态或身份时不能省略系动词 is；She happy. 缺少本句需要的 is。",
      "examples": [
        {
          "sentence": "She is happy.",
          "translation": "她很开心。",
          "exampleOrigin": "manual"
